        <briefdescription>
<para>Part of the time_interp interface, calculates for cyclical data Time_beg and Time_end mark a repeating period. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Finds mid points and fractional weight for a time perioid</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">time</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>a specific time value</para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
